(Japanese: '''リキシータウン''' ''Rikishii Town'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location in [[Johto]]. It is located in between [[Ecruteak City]] and [[Olivine City]]. It was featured in ''[[EP194|Ring Masters]]''.

The town's main attraction is a [[Sumo Conference]] involving Pokémon facing off against each other. {{Ash}} used the local [[Pokémon Center]] to have his {{AP|Snorlax}} transferred to Rikishii Town so he could compete. He then entered the competition against the defending champion [[Raiden]] and his {{p|Feraligatr}}. It defeated Raiden's Feraligatr, and Ash received a [[King's Rock]] for his victory.

==Trivia==
* Rikishi is Japanese for "Sumo Wrestler".
* It is never referred to by name in the dub, but instead as "a quaint little village".

